Police said officers were called at 1:35pm local time following reports of a man inside the enclosure, where a Siberian tiger attacked him.",
   "The man was pronounced dead at the scene despite the efforts of paramedics, police said. His family has been notified. The tiger was uninjured, and police said there was no wider risk to the public.",
   "The park was evacuated and closed for the weekend following the incident. Witnesses reported seeing the man jump into the enclosure and hearing shots fired into the pen.",
   "## Why it matters",
   "The death is a rare and shocking incident at a major UK wildlife attraction; the park and police are expected to review how the man gained access to the enclosure."
  ],
