 {
  "id": "art-0025-shelton-gea-shanghai-masters-2026",
  "slug": "ben-shelton-arthur-gea-shanghai-masters-upset-2026",
  "headline": "\"I Got Outplayed\": Ben Shelton Falls to France's Arthur Gea in Shanghai Masters Upset",
  "socialHeadline": "World No. 4 Ben Shelton was stunned 7-6(5), 7-6(3) by 21-year-old Arthur Gea in the third round of the Shanghai Masters \u2014 the Frenchman's first win over a top-10 player",
  "summary": "US Open finalist Ben Shelton was knocked out of the Shanghai Masters on Sunday, losing 7-6(5), 7-6(3) to France's Arthur Gea in the third round. The world No. 56 claimed the biggest win of his career, while Shelton admitted he had been outplayed.",
  "body": [
   "Ben Shelton's Shanghai Masters campaign ended in the third round on Sunday as the world No. 4 fell 7-6(5), 7-6(3) to France's Arthur Gea, according to Reuters. It was the 21-year-old Frenchman's first victory over a top-10 player and one of the biggest upsets of the 2026 season.",
   "Both sets were decided in tiebreaks. Shelton, whose powerful left-handed serve is usually his biggest weapon, managed just 63% of points behind his first delivery as Gea's disciplined returning kept him under constant pressure. The American faced three match points at 6-3 in the second-set tiebreaker; Gea converted the first.",
   "## Shelton's honest assessment",
   "Shelton was candid after the defeat. \"I mean, I got outplayed today. The guy played better than me,\" he told reporters, according to Reuters. He pointed to his lack of preparation since September's US Open final, where he lost to Alexander Zverev: \"A hundred percent, I would have liked to have come over here earlier and be prepared and have already dealt with the jet lag by the time I was playing here in the Shanghai Masters.\"",
   "The 24-year-old has barely played since New York, withdrawing from the Japan Open in Tokyo over fitness concerns. \"My body wasn't ready. I wasn't physically ready to play in Tokyo. That's just the way this tour is sometimes,\" he said.",
   "Shelton, who won his first match in Shanghai on his 24th birthday, now turns his focus to the season-ending ATP Finals in Turin next month. \"Obviously I want to be prepared and playing some of my best tennis when I get there,\" he added. \"Three tournaments left to finish the year, which has been a very up and down year, but a great year, on a high note.\"",
   "## A breakthrough for Gea",
   "Gea, ranked 56th in the world, was delighted with a result he called special. \"I'm practicing hard every day since the beginning of the year to win against those guys,\" he said. \"Of course, when you win, it is always special. But, yeah, I was prepared and I was confident before the match.\"",
   "The Frenchman now faces either Jakub Mensik or Francisco Cerundolo for a place in the quarter-finals.",
   "Elsewhere on Sunday, 26th seed Karen Khachanov beat Adrian Mannarino 6-2, 6-4, while top seed and US Open champion Alexander Zverev was scheduled for a night match against Quentin Halys. No. 1-ranked Jannik Sinner withdrew from Shanghai earlier in the week, announcing he is taking the rest of 2026 off because of a right knee injury, the Associated Press reported."
  ],
  "category": "Sports",
  "tags": [
   "Tennis",
   "ATP",
   "Shanghai Masters",
   "Ben Shelton",
   "Arthur Gea"
  ],
